  "text": "BluePearl Pet Hospital | Brandon, FL\nSkip to the content\nJoin the BluePearl Family!\nWe're hiring.\nFind a Hospital\nSearch the site\nSearch\nSearch the site\nSearch\nResources for Pet Owners\nWhy BluePearl\nIntake Form\nPay with CareCredit\nPet Care Articles and Videos\nStories from the Heart\nResources for Veterinarians\nWhy Refer to BluePearl\nReferral Portal & Medical Records\nOrder BluePearl Materials\nMedical Library for DVMs\nAbout Us\nWho We Are\nOur Areas of Expertise\nNewsroom\nContact Us\nCareers\nFind a Hospital\nHome\nHospitals\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Brandon, FL\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nBrandon, FL\n24/7 Emergency and Specialty\n813.571.3303\n607 Lumsden Professional Ct.\nBrandon, FL 33511\n[email protected]\nEmergency:\n24/7\nSpecialty:\nBy appointment\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nOverview\nServices\nOur vets\nReferring vets\nRequest Appointment\nBluePearl Pet Hospital Brandon – serving east Hillsborough County.\nOur pet hospital is located in Brandon and serves east Tampa, Lakeland, Riverview, Lithia, Valrico, Plant City and other communities in Hillsborough County and the Tampa Bay area.\nOur reviews.\nOur services.\nWhen you have a pet emergency, seconds count. We want you to know, we’re ready. If your pet has a condition that requires a specialist’s expertise, we’re ready for that too. Our experienced team of veterinarians, vet technicians and support staff work closely together to provide the comprehensive, compassionate care your pet needs and deserves.\nEmergency\nCall ahead to our 24-hour emergency vet hospital in Brandon and let us know you’re coming. No appointment is necessary.\nLearn more about your emergency visit\n.\nSpecialty care\nSpecialists at BluePearl veterinary hospitals work directly with your primary care vet to understand your pet’s condition and develop the appropriate treatment plan. Visits to our specialists are usually by referral from your primary care vet and by appointment.\nLearn more about veterinary specialists\n.\nSee Specialties and Services\nOur\nveterinarians.\nCaring for your pets is our passion. Meet our team of veterinarians here to help you and your pet.\nSee Veterinarians\nAbout BluePearl Pet Hospital Brandon\nThe BluePearl pet hospital in Brandon features six exam rooms and a surgical suite that is equipped for orthopedic and soft tissue surgeries.\nWe also perform ultrasounds, endoscopies and x-rays to diagnose pet conditions. We are a fully-equipped 24-hour pet hospital.\nPet owners\nAt BluePearl Pet Hospitals, providing our customers with remarkable service is a top priority. We’re committed to making your veterinary visit as smooth as possible.\nHave questions prior to your visit? We’re happy to help. Contact our hospital team at\n813.571.3303\nor\n[email protected]\n.\nTestimonials.\n“My 16-year-old cat became ill, so I took her in to BluePearl in Brandon at 9:00 pm on a Saturday. The entire staff was amazing. Sadly, Mystic didn’t make it, but they were so wonderful in helping me cope with losing her. Can’t say enough good about this crew of humans! Thank you, from the bottom of my heart.”\n—Kim S.\n“I have been to BluePearl in Brandon on three occasions with two of my pets. I wouldn’t ever go anywhere else. They are compassionate, kind and empathetic. They helped ease my stress and worry by giving both of my pet babies, Hershey and Bootsy, the highest and most professional level of care during each of their emergencies.”\n—Sheila and Alfredo L.\nCurrent location.\n813.571.3303\n813.571.3373\n607 Lumsden Professional Ct.\nBrandon,\nFL                                    33511\n[email protected]\nOther hospitals.\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nTampa, FL\n3000 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa, FL 33614\n813.933.8944\n14.45 miles\nBluePearl Pet Surgery\nTown ‘n’ Country\nTampa, FL\n7512 Paula Dr\nTampa, FL 33615\n813.901.5100\n17.42 miles\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\nClearwater, FL\n4701 Ulmerton Rd., Ste. 500\nClearwater, FL 33762\n727.572.0132\n24.81 miles\nGet In Touch\nBluePearl Pet Hospital\n2950 Busch Lake Blvd.\nTampa\n, FL\n33614\nContact Us\nFind a Hospital Near Me\nCareers at BluePearl\nBluePearl™ Cares\nWeb Accessibility\nYour Privacy Choices\nStay Connected\nHere for pets.\nWhen it matters most.\nStay connected with BluePearl for expert advice, helpful tips and trusted information to support you and your pet - delivered straight to your inbox.\nSign Up\ncookies notice\nprivacy policy\nlegal\nad choices\nterms & conditions\naccessibility\ncontact us\na\nbrand\n© 2026 BluePearl Holdings LLC. All rights reserved.\nCookie Settings",
